@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Resumefolio | Protected-request authorization
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1C3453
 BorderColor #9FB2CD
 FontColor #F1F5F9
 DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
 DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
 StartColor #F1F5F9
 EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Identify requested protected resource and operation;
if (Employer-sharing path?) then (yes)
 :Evaluate eligible link and valid sharing context;
 :Limit scope to selected content / permitted retrieval;
else (account / client context)
 :Evaluate valid identity or agreed client credential context;
 :Identify explicit ownership, membership or administrative grants;
endif
if (Valid context and authority for this resource / action / state?) then (yes)
 :Perform only the authorized requested operation; <<#173B34>>
else (no)
 :Deny protected operation / disclosure; <<#49351C>>
endif
stop
legend bottom
Conceptual requirements flow; authentication factors, protocols and timing remain to be defined.
Successful sign-in or a role label alone does not grant every resource/action.
Direct file/PDF and client requests remain within applicable authorization boundaries.
endlegend
@enduml
